body: "## Finding\n\nA value-redacted full-history audit found package-owned PM evidence containing absolute home-path values in 12 reachable commits / 32 patch lines, plus 97 commits with a non-noreply personal-domain author identity and one localhost identity. Historical vendored dependencies also contain generic private-IP/email fixtures. No private-key pattern was found, and current tracked source contains no absolute home path or private IP.\n\nThe actual personal address, username, and host path are intentionally omitted from this public issue.\n\n## Required decision\n\n- review the value-redacted inventory\n- explicitly authorize retention or a coordinated history rewrite\n- if rewriting, preserve PM semantic history and coordinate tags/forks/releases\n- rerun current-file, full patch/blob, author-identity, tarball, and GitHub secret scans\n- do not merge or publish the current hardening PR while this remains unresolved\n\n## PM evidence\n\n- [pm-todos-oz1n](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-todos/blob/fix/canonical-certified-list-reader-2026-8-21/.agents/pm/issues/pm-todos-oz1n.toon)\n- [canonical reader delivery item](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-todos/blob/fix/canonical-certified-list-reader-2026-8-21/.agents/pm/issues/pm-todos-x5my.toon)\n\nThis issue does not authorize a rewrite, tag move, merge, or publication."
